 ### UI (Common)
 
-- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5513+) **Optionally** support **upscaling font size (i.e. font size)** regardless of game resolution. This affects **main interface** (city screen, map view, `city_billboard`/`CITYBILLBOARD`), **advisors**, **sevopedia**, most of **diplomacy screen** (when it was possible; in [CvDiplomacy.py](/Assets/Python/CvDiplomacy.py) and `CvPlayer::getItemTradeString` (for trading table)) and other places where font size could be changed. Made some **UI adjustments when needed to accomodate the larger text**. Upscaling text can be **useful for high resolution displays** (where text appears very small), but may **also improve readability at smaller resolutions** (like 1920*1080 or lower). See [GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml](/Assets/XML/GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml) and related places for the change.
+- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5513+) **Optionally** support **upscaling font size (i.e. font size)** regardless of game resolution. This affects **main interface** (city screen, map view, `city_billboard`/`CITYBILLBOARD`), **advisors**, **sevopedia**, most of **diplomacy screen** (when it was possible) in [CvDiplomacy.py](/Assets/Python/CvDiplomacy.py) and `CvPlayer::getItemTradeString` (for trading table), **Event Log** window (as of now only **Event Log** and **Combat Log** tabs are supported) and **event message popup** (top-center) in [CvUtil.py](/Assets/Python/CvUtil.py) and [CvEventManager.py](/Assets/Python/CvEventManager.py) and `CvDLLInterfaceIFaceBase::addMessage` (note: Event related message upscaling **only applies to new messages written after upscaling is enabled**, not to previously written event messages before upscaling was applied), and other places where font size could be changed. Made some **UI adjustments when needed to accomodate the larger text**. Upscaling text can be **useful for high resolution displays** (where text appears very small), but may **also improve readability at smaller resolutions** (like 1920*1080 or lower). See [GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml](/Assets/XML/GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml) and related places for the change.
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5530+) **Upscaling adjustments** include notably: smaller sevopedia leaders item row (else AI Personality Panel's upscaled text overfills), **smaller Sevopedia speeds first column** (only at **lower resolutions** since these don't have enough horizontal room per column to show them without clipping),  **overwrite city `billboard` xml** in [CIV4DetailManager.xml](/Assets/XML/Misc/CIV4DetailManager.xml) **at runtime** via [SASBillboardScale.py](/Assets/Python/SASBillboardScale.py) (**tunable per font size**), increase **GP bar size** and reduce **tech bar size** in **main interface (common)**, **do not upscale icons** in the Foreign Diplomacy Advisor's **Glance Tab** when text is upscaled and there are **>= 2 icons** (e.g., worst enemy + at war icons) (See [KI#116](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#116---worked-around-foreign-diplomacy-advisor-glance-tab-clips-trailing-status-icons-at-upscaled-label-fonts)), added **attitude icon chars** in [GameFont.tga](/Assets/res/Fonts/GameFont.tga) (21x20 icon size): previously they existed only in [GameFont_75.tga](/Assets/res/Fonts/GameFont_75.tga) (16x16 icon size), causing attitude icon chars to **disappear** (e.g., in Score Tab) **when font was upscaled (attitude font size >= 3)** (see [KI#117](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#117---fixed-score-tab-attitude-icon-chars-disappearing-at-upscaled-label-fonts-sas_ui_font_label-34)).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5527+) **Increase hover text** base **font size** from **2 to 3** and most UI elements (e.g., scoreboard, advisors, main interface, sevopedia) **from body (i.e. 2) to label (i.e. 3)**, and **increased font2 billboard from 100 to 120 percent** so it is **more readable**.
 - Added **Emojis** without having to tediously implement them as characters. See [Emojis](/README.md#emojis) and [CIV4ArtDefines_Interface.xml](/Assets/XML/Art/CIV4ArtDefines_Interface.xml).

